+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BGSI> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithology> "http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll/OLBA"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
